{"verse":18,"translation":"And one of the young men answered and said, “Behold, I have seen a son of Jesse the Bethlehemite, who knows how to play, and a mighty man of valor, and a man of war, and discerning in speech, and a man of appearance — and YHWH is with him.”","tokens":[{"surface":"ויען","gloss":"and answered"},{"surface":"אחד","gloss":"one"},{"surface":"מהנערים","gloss":"of the young men"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"and said"},{"surface":"הנה","gloss":"Behold"},{"surface":"ראיתי","gloss":"I have seen"},{"surface":"בן","gloss":"a son"},{"surface":"לישי","gloss":"of Jesse"},{"surface":"בית","gloss":"Beth"},{"surface":"הלחמי","gloss":"lehemite"},{"surface":"ידע","gloss":"knowing"},{"surface":"נגן","gloss":"to play"},{"surface":"וגבור","gloss":"and a mighty man"},{"surface":"חיל","gloss":"of valor"},{"surface":"ואיש","gloss":"and a man"},{"surface":"מלחמה","gloss":"of war"},{"surface":"ונבון","gloss":"and discerning"},{"surface":"דבר","gloss":"in speech"},{"surface":"ואיש","gloss":"and a man"},{"surface":"תאר","gloss":"of appearance"},{"surface":"ויהוה","gloss":"and YHWH"},{"surface":"עמו","gloss":"with him"}],"pass":"en5","judge":"glm-5.3"}